{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galaxy Engine is a particle physics sandbox in which you can simulate the Universe in an easy and interactive way. Create visually stunning cosmic simulations with just a few clicks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Intergalactic Simulation<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/ManyGalaxies.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simulate galaxies, clusters, and even the Big Bang.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/BigBang.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fluid Simulations</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with planetary formations and collisions thanks to Smoothed Particle Hydrodynamics (SPH) fluids.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/SPH1.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/SPH2.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Visuals Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the many visual settings available to achieve the look you want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/Customization.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Render High-Quality Simulations</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galaxy Engine allows you to export videos and frames of simulations with millions of particles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/Recording.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Result:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/Result.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762210?t=1750895802","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/49650ae13ff7738ecc57aab48f50f446e6a2933b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750895802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/27d9c3e0768235ca334fa702de4138ccbc476550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750895802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/27d9c3e0768235ca334fa702de4138ccbc476550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750895802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galaxy Engine is a particle physics sandbox in which you can simulate the Universe in an easy and interactive way. Create visually stunning cosmic simulations with just a few clicks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Intergalactic Simulation<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/ManyGalaxies.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simulate galaxies, clusters, and even the Big Bang.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/BigBang.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fluid Simulations</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with planetary formations and collisions thanks to Smoothed Particle Hydrodynamics (SPH) fluids.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/SPH1.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/SPH2.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Visuals Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the many visual settings available to achieve the look you want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/Customization.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Render High-Quality Simulations</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Galaxy Engine allows you to export videos and frames of simulations with millions of particles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/Recording.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Result:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/extras/Result.gif?t=1750895802\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Narcis Calin"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762210/a885db2f97afc93588990d7c93d5320da6ec687e/he